hadiths[10]{hadithnumber,text}:
"848","[AI-translation] Nafi se, Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne apni biwi ko haiz mein talaq di. To Umar ne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poocha. To Aap ne usay hukm diya ke wo us se ruju karay, phir usay mohlat de yahan tak ke wo doosra haiz aaye, phir usay mohlat de yahan tak ke wo paak ho, phir usay haath laganay se pehle talaq de. To yehi wo iddat hai jis ka Allah Taala ne hukm diya hai ke auraton ko us ke liye talaq di jaye. To Ibn Umar se jab us mard ke baaray mein poocha jata jo apni biwi ko haiz mein talaq de to wo kehtay: Raha tum ne usay aik ya do talaqein din, to beshak Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne usay hukm diya ke wo us se ruju karay, phir usay mohlat de yahan tak ke wo doosra haiz aaye, phir usay mohlat de yahan tak ke wo paak ho, phir usay haath laganay se pehle talaq de. Aur raha tum ne usay teen talaqein din to beshak tum ne apne Rab ki nafarmani ki jis ka us ne tumhein tumhari biwi ki talaq mein hukm diya tha, aur wo tum se juda ho gayi. (Muslim: 4/180)"
"849","[AI-translation] Ibn Sirin se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main bees saal raha ke mujhe wo bayan kartay thay jin par main tohmat nahi rakhta ke Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ne apni biwi ko teen talaqein haiz mein din to unhein hukm diya gaya ke wo us se ruju karein. To main un par tohmat na rakhta tha aur hadees ko na pehchanta tha, yahan tak ke main Abu Ghallab Yunus bin Jubair Bahili se mila, aur wo pukhta (sabt) thay. To unhon ne mujhe bayan kiya ke unhon ne Ibn Umar se poocha to unhon ne unhein bayan kiya ke unhon ne apni biwi ko aik talaq haiz mein di to unhein hukm diya gaya ke wo us se ruju karein. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Kya wo us par gini gayi? Unhon ne kaha: To kya, agar wo aajiz ho gaya aur bewaqoof bana? (Muslim: 4/181). Baab: Rasoolullah ke zamanay mein teen ka talaq. (Sabat se murad pukhta hona hai; murad inkari sawal hai, taqdeer hai ke haan gini gayi.)"
"850","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam), Abu Bakr aur Umar (raziyallahu anhum) ki khilafat ke do saal tak teen ka talaq aik (shumar hota) tha. To Umar bin Khattab ne kaha: Beshak logon ne us muamlay mein jaldi ki hai jis mein unhein mohlat di gayi thi. To agar ham usay (teen) naafiz kar dein to munasib hai. Phir unhon ne usay naafiz kar diya. (Muslim)."
"851","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rifa Qurazi ne apni biwi ko talaq di aur us ki talaq ko poora (teen) kar diya. Phir us ke baad us ne Abdur Rahman bin Zubair se shaadi ki. To wo Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aayi aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Beshak wo Rifa ke nikah mein thi, phir us ne usay aakhri teen talaqein de din. Phir us ke baad main ne Abdur Rahman bin Zubair se shaadi ki, aur beshak Allah ki qasam us ke paas kapray ke kinare jaisi (cheez) ke siwa kuch nahi. To us ne apni chadar ke kinaray se pakra. Unhon ne kaha: To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) muskuratay hue hansay. To Aap ne farmaya: Shayad tum Rifa ki taraf wapas jana chahti ho? Nahi, yahan tak ke wo tumhara maza chakhay aur tum us ka maza chakho. Aur Abu Bakr Siddiq Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas baithay hue thay aur Khalid bin Sa'id bin Aas hujray ke darwazay par baithay thay jinhein ijazat nahi di gayi thi. Unhon ne kaha: To Khalid Abu Bakr ko pukarnay lagay: Kya tum isay nahi rokhtay jo wo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas buland awaz se kehti hai? (Muslim: 4/154) Baab: Haraam (kar denay) ke baaray mein, aur Allah Taala ka qaul: Ae Nabi! Tum usay kyun haraam kartay ho jo Allah ne tumharay liye halal kiya, aur is mein ikhtilaf. (Batt se murad teen kar ke poora karna hai; hudba se murad kapray ka kinara hai.)"
"852","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab aadmi apni biwi ko apne upar haraam kar le to wo qasam hai jis ka wo kaffara de ga. Aur beshak tumharay liye Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mein behtareen namuna tha. (Muslim: 4/184). (Muslim mein fahi hai.)"
"853","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Zainab bint Jahsh ke paas thehray kartay aur un ke paas shehad peetay. Unhon ne kaha: To main ne aur Hafsa ne aapas mein muahida kiya ke ham mein se jis ke paas Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) dakhil hon wo kahay: Beshak main tum se maghafeer ki boo patati hun, tum ne maghafeer khaye hain. To Aap un mein se aik ke paas dakhil hue to us ne Aap se ye kaha. To Aap ne farmaya: Balke main ne Zainab bint Jahsh ke paas shehad piya hai aur main us ki taraf kabhi wapas nahi aaun ga. To naazil hui: Tum usay kyun haraam kartay ho jo Allah ne tumharay liye halal kiya, us ke qaul tak: Agar tum donon tauba karo, Aisha aur Hafsa ke liye, aur: Jab Nabi ne apni baaz azwaaj se poshida baat kahi, Aap ke qaul: Balke main ne shehad piya hai, ki wajah se. (Muslim: 4/184). (Tawatait ka asal tawataat hai, murad aapas mein muahida hai; maghafeer meethi cheez hai jis ki boo buri hoti hai; is mein ikhtisar hai, Bukhari ki tafseer mein poora hai ke Aap ne qasam khai thi ke dobara na piyun ga.)"
"854","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) meethi cheez aur shehad bohat pasand kartay thay. Aur Aap ki mubarak aadat thi ke jab Aap Asr ki namaz padh chuktay to apni azwaaj-e-mutahharat ke paas aatay aur har aik se qareeb hotay. To aik din Hafsa (raziyallahu anha) ke paas aaye aur wahan aur dinon se zyada thehray to mere is ka sabab daryaft karnay par maloom hua ke un ki qaum ki aik aurat ke paas se un ke paas shehad ki aik kuppi hadiye mein aayi thi, aur unhon ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko shehad ka sharbat pilaya hai. To main ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam ham un se aik tadbeer karein gi. Main ne Sauda (raziyallahu anha) se zikr kiya aur un se kaha ke jab Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) tumharay paas aayein aur tum se qareeb hon to tum kehna ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Kya Aap ne maghafeer khaya hai? Aap kahein ge nahi, to tum Aap se kehna ke phir ye badboo kaisi hai? Aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki aadat thi ke Aap ko is baat se bohat nafrat thi ke Aap se badboo aaye. Phir Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) tum se kahein ge ke mujhe Hafsa ne shehad pilaya hai, tab tum Aap se kehna ke shayad us ki makkhi ne urfut ke darakht se ras choos liya hai, urfut usi darakht ka naam hai jis ka gond maghafeer hai. Aur main bhi un se aisa hi kahun gi aur Ae Safiyya (raziyallahu anha) tum bhi Aap se aisa hi kehna. Phir jab Aap Sauda (raziyallahu anha) ke paas aaye to Sauda (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke qasam hai us Allah ki ke us ke siwa koi mabood nahi, main qareeb thi ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se bahar nikal kar wohi baat kahun jo tum ne, Ae Aisha, mujh se kahi thi aur Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) darwazay par thay aur mera kehnay mein is tarah jaldi karna tumharay darr se tha, phir jab Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) nazdeek hue to unhon ne kaha ke kya Aap ne maghafeer khaya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi. Phir unhon ne kaha ke ye badboo kis ki hai? Aap ne farmaya ke mujhe Hafsa ne shehad ka sharbat pilaya hai. Tab unhon ne kaha ke makkhi ne urfut ka ras choos liya hai, is liye us ki boo shehad mein aa gayi hai. Phir jab mere paas aaye to main ne, Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne bhi Aap se yehi kaha. Phir Safiyya (raziyallahu anha) ke paas gaye aur unhon ne bhi aisa hi kaha, to jab dobara Hafsa (raziyallahu anha) ke paas gaye to unhon ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Main is mein se Aap ke liye shehad laun? To Aap ne farmaya ke mujhe is ki koi zaroorat nahi hai. Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Sauda (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke SubhanAllah! Ham ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko shehad peenay se rok diya, to Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke main ne un se kaha ke chup raho. (Muslim). (Ukka shehad ka bartan hai; maghafeer meethi cheez hai jis ki boo buri hoti hai.)"
"855","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se ijazat maangnay aaye to unhon ne logon ko Aap ke darwazay par baithay paya jin mein se kisi ko ijazat nahi di gayi thi. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ko ijazat di gayi to wo dakhil hue. Phir Umar (raziyallahu anhu) aaye aur ijazat maangi to unhein ijazat di gayi. To unhon ne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko paya ke Aap baithay thay aur Aap ke gird Aap ki biwiyan thin, Aap ghamgeen khamosh thay. Unhon ne kaha: To unhon ne kaha: Main zaroor aisi baat kahun ga jo Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko hansaye. To unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Kaash aap dekhte ke Kharija ki beti ne mujh se kharch manga to main us ki taraf utha aur us ki gardan marori. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hansay aur farmaya: Ye mere gird jaisa tum dekhtay ho mujh se kharch maangti hain. To Abu Bakr Aisha ki taraf uthay aur un ki gardan marornay lagay, aur Umar Hafsa ki taraf uthay aur un ki gardan marornay lagay, donon kehtay thay: Tum Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se wo maangti ho jo Aap ke paas nahi. Unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Ham Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se kabhi wo cheez nahi maangein gi jo Aap ke paas nahi. Phir Aap un se aik maheena ya untees din alag rahay. Phir Aap par ye aayat naazil hui: Ae Nabi! Apni biwiyon se kaho, yahan tak ke: Tum mein se neki karnay waliyon ke liye bara ajar hai. Unhon ne kaha: To Aap ne Aisha se shuru kiya aur farmaya: Ae Aisha! Beshak main tumharay saamnay aik muamla paish karna chahta hun, main chahta hun ke tum us mein jaldi na karo yahan tak ke apne walidain se mashwara kar lo. Unhon ne kaha: Wo kya hai, Ae Allah ke Rasool? To Aap ne unhein aayat padh kar sunayi. Unhon ne kaha: Kya Aap ke baaray mein, Ae Allah ke Rasool, main apne walidain se mashwara karun? Balke main Allah, Us ke Rasool aur aakhirat ke ghar ko ikhtiyar karti hun. Aur main Aap se sawal karti hun ke Aap apni biwiyon mein se kisi aurat ko wo na batayein jo main ne kaha. Aap ne farmaya: Mujh se un mein se koi aurat nahi poochay gi magar main usay bataun ga ke Allah Taala ne mujhe sakhti karnay wala ya sakhti dhoondnay wala bana kar nahi bheja, lekin mujhe sikhhanay wala, aasani karnay wala bana kar bheja hai. (Muslim: 4/187-188). (Wajim se murad ghamgeen khamosh hona hai.)"
"856","[AI-translation] Masrooq se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe parwa nahi ke main ne apni biwi ko aik ya sau ya hazaar ka ikhtiyar diya jabke wo mujhe ikhtiyar karay. Aur beshak main ne Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se poocha to unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein ikhtiyar diya tha, to kya wo talaq tha? (Muslim: 4/186)"
"857","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main aik saal raha jabke main Umar bin Khattab se aik aayat ke baaray mein poochna chahta tha magar un ki haibat ki wajah se pooch na sakta tha, yahan tak ke wo hajj ko niklay to main un ke saath nikla. Phir jab wo wapas hue aur ham rastay mein thay to wo apni haajat ke liye arak (ke darakhton) ki taraf hatay. To main un ke liye khada raha yahan tak ke wo farigh hue, phir main un ke saath chala aur kaha: Ae Ameerul Momineen! Wo kaun si do hain jinhon ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke khilaf Aap ki azwaaj mein se ittehad kiya? To unhon ne kaha: Wo Hafsa aur Aisha thin. Unhon ne kaha: To main ne un se kaha: Allah ki qasam! Beshak main aik saal se tum se is ke baaray mein poochna chahta tha magar tumhari haibat ki wajah se taqat nahi rakhta tha. Unhon ne kaha: To aisa na karo, jo tum samjho ke mere paas ilm hai to mujh se us ke baaray mein poocho, agar main usay janta hun ga to tumhein bataun ga. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Umar ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Beshak ham zamanay jahiliyat mein auraton ke muamlay ko kuch na samajhtay thay yahan tak ke Allah Taala ne un ke baaray mein jo naazil kiya wo naazil kiya aur un ke liye jo taqseem kiya wo taqseem kiya. Unhon ne kaha: Phir jabke main apne aik muamlay mein tha jis mein main apne aap se mashwara kar raha tha ke meri biwi ne mujh se kaha: Kaash tum aisa aisa karo. To main ne us se kaha: Tumhein yahan ke muamlay se kya? Tumhein is muamlay mein takalluf kya jo main chahta hun? To us ne mujh se kaha: Ae Ibn Khattab! Tum par taajjub hai, tum nahi chahtay ke tum se jawab diya jaye jabke tumhari beti Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko jawab deti hai yahan tak ke wo apna din ghussay mein guzartay hain. Umar ne kaha: To main apni chadar pakarta hun phir apni jagah se nikalta hun yahan tak ke Hafsa ke paas dakhil hota hun. To main ne us se kaha: Ae meri beti! Beshak tum Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko jawab deti ho yahan tak ke wo apna din ghussay mein guzartay hain. To Hafsa ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Beshak ham Aap ko jawab detay hain. To main ne kaha: Tum janti ho ke main tumhein Allah ki saza aur Us ke Rasool ke ghussay se daraata hun. Ae meri beti! Tumhein wo dhoka na de jisay us ka husn aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki us se mohabbat ne maghroor kiya hai. Phir main nikla yahan tak ke Umm Salama ke paas dakhil hua apni rishtadari ki wajah se. To main ne us se baat ki. To Umm Salama ne mujh se kaha: Ae Ibn Khattab! Tum par taajjub hai, tum har cheez mein dakhil ho gaye ho yahan tak ke tum chahtay ho ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aur Aap ki azwaaj ke darmiyan dakhil ho. Unhon ne kaha: To unhon ne mujhe aisa pakra ke us ne mujhe us se tor diya jo main (dil mein) pata tha. To main un ke paas se nikla. Aur mera Ansaar mein se aik saathi tha, jab main ghair haazir hota to wo mere paas khabar lata aur jab wo ghair haazir hota to main us ke paas khabar le jata. Aur ham us waqt Ghassan ke baadshahon mein se aik baadshah se dartay thay, ham se zikr kiya gaya tha ke wo hamari taraf aana chahta hai, to hamaray seenay us se bhar gaye thay. To mera Ansari saathi darwaza khatkhatata hua aaya aur kaha: Kholo, kholo. To main ne kaha: Ghassani aaya hai? Us ne kaha: Us se zyada sakht (khabar hai): Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apni azwaaj se alahdagi ikhtiyar ki hai. To main ne kaha: Hafsa aur Aisha ki naak khaak aalood ho. Phir main apna kapra pakarta hun aur nikalta hun yahan tak ke main aaya. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) apne aik baala khanay mein thay jis par khajoor ki seedhi se chadha jata tha, aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka aik siyah ghulam seedhi ke saray par tha. To main ne kaha: Ye Umar hai. To mujhe ijazat di gayi. Umar ne kaha: To main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se ye hadees bayan ki. Phir jab main Umm Salama ki baat tak pahuncha to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) muskuraye jabke Aap chatai par thay jis ke aur Aap ke darmiyan kuch na tha, aur Aap ke sar ke neechay chamray ka takiya tha jis mein (khajoor ki) chhaal bhari thi, aur Aap ke paon ke paas qarz jama kiya hua tha aur Aap ke sar ke paas khaalein latki hui thin. To main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke pehlu mein chatai ka nishan dekha to main roya. To Aap ne farmaya: Tumhein kya rulata hai? To main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Beshak Kisra aur Qaisar jis mein hain us mein hain jabke Aap Allah ke Rasool hain. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum raazi nahi ke un donon ke liye duniya ho aur tumharay liye aakhirat ho? (Muslim: 4/190). (Atamiro se murad apne aap se mashwara karna hai; ujala khajoor ki seedhi hai; qaraz jama kiya hua (chamra rangnay ka masala) hai; uhab dabaghat se pehle ki khaalon ki jama hai; murad duniya aur us ki zeenat hai.)"
